data: {"id": "9c93b03ccf6740ff-thinking-parallel_evidence-800", "run_id": "9c93b03ccf6740ff", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "事实清晰了。\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 生命周期与状态**\n- `execute_pod_promql` 实时确认：`kube_pod_status_phase` 中 phase=\"Pending\"=1，其余 phase=0，Pod 仍处于 Pending 状态未恢复。Pod UID 为 `78de30b1-06ec-4314-9120-26d93c29a48a`。\n- `kubectl describe pod`：`node: <none>`，状态 Pending。\n\n**调度失败根因（来自 describe + events）**\n- Scheduler 事件（持续 66 分钟，x13 重复）：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n- Pod 的 Node-Selector：**`aiops.lab/unavailable=true`**\n\n**节点实际标签（来自 `kubectl get nodes --show-labels`）**\n- 3 个节点（", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788764604895, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

