data: {"id": "9c93b03ccf6740ff-final", "run_id": "9c93b03ccf6740ff", "seq": 805, "ts_ms": 1788764621690, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod workload-68c557d875-bsq52 in namespace aiops-case-01 is stuck in Pending state with FailedScheduling events. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.status` | status: `Pending` | 确定 Pod 当前停留在调度阶段，未完成启动 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `event.message` | `FailedScheduling`: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 提供调度的直接失败原因及集群节点数量（3个） |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.cpu` | `app`: `5m` | 排除 CPU 资源耗尽导致的调度失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.memory` | `app`: `8Mi` | 排除内存资源耗尽导致的调度失败 |\n| 5 | Metric | `kube_pod_status_phase` | 值: `1`, labels: `phase: Pending` | 从观测层面确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，排除 Unknown 状态波动 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n1. Pod 当前状态（#1）与调度失败事件（#2）高度一致。\n2. 尽管 CPU 和内存请求量极低（#3、#4），调度仍然失败，证明瓶颈不在资源计算，而在其他过滤条件（如标签）。\n3. 事件明确指出“0/3 nodes are available”是由于“didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector”（#2），这直接指向了配置层面的选择器不匹配。\n4. 度量数据（#5）持续确认 Pending 状态，排除了瞬时波动或状态不一致的可能。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了 node_selector 'aiops.lab/unavailable=true' → 调度器匹配集群节点标签 → 集群中 3 个节点均不存在该标签 → 调度器拒绝分配任何节点 → Pod 保持在 Pending 状态并产生 FailedScheduling 事件\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**Pod 的 `node_selector` 设置了一个在集群中不存在的标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。**\n\n该配置直接导致 Kubernetes 调度器在遍历集群内的所有可用节点时，无法找到任何节点满足调度条件。结合 `FailedScheduling` 事件明确指出的“0/3 nodes are available”及“didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector”原因，以及资源请求（5m CPU, 8Mi Memory）远未触及集群瓶颈的事实，可以判定该调度策略配置错误是 Pod 无法调度的决定性原因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 43.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52: 43.9s (Evidence 35.6s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 69.638, "metrics": {"run_id": "9c93b03ccf6740ff", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 69.63920307159424, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 69639.20307159424, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 62645.16472816467, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 18523.205757141113, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6668.398141860962}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "du